        <span style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(138,43,226,0.8);font-weight:700;background:rgba(138,43,226,0.1);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(138,43,226,0.2)">🔔 Notificações</span>
